  entries:
  - taskId: cirak_0
    lesson:
      title: 
      pages: []
    reasoning:
      question: "Terazinin iki kefesi neden e\u015Fit kald\u0131?"
      options:
      - Atomlar yok olmaz, yoktan da var olmaz.
      - "Kazan kapal\u0131 oldu\u011Fu i\xE7in hava girmedi."
      - "Hidrojen hafif oldu\u011Fu i\xE7in tart\u0131lmaz."
      correctIndex: 0
      replies:
      - "Aynen \xF6yle. Ne girdiyse o \xE7\u0131kt\u0131; deftere ilk kural\u0131
        yaz."
      - "Kapak tek ba\u015F\u0131na a\xE7\u0131klamaz. Is\u0131tsan da a\xE7\u0131k
        b\u0131raksan da bu kazanda atom ne kaybolur ne t\xFCrer."
      - "Hafif de olsa her atom say\u0131l\u0131r. D\xF6rt H girdi, d\xF6rt H \xE7\u0131kt\u0131."
    discoveryId: K-0
    discoveryText: "Kazana ne girerse o \xE7\u0131kar: tepkimede atomlar kaybolmaz,
      yoktan var olmaz."
    topic: "K\xFCtlenin korunumu"
    title: "\xC7\u0131rakl\u0131k: \u0130lk Kural"
    placeLine: "C\xE2bir Usta, at\xF6lye"
    equation: "2H<sub>2</sub> \u2192 2H<sub>2</sub>"
    iconFormula: H2
    usage: 
    fieldNotes: []
  - taskId: denk_1
    lesson:
      title: Atomlar kaybolmaz
      pages:
      - blocks:
        - kind: 0
          text: Ders notu
          detail: "Denkle\u015Ftirme K\xF6y\xFC, 1. g\xF6rev"
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 1
          text: Atomlar kaybolmaz
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 3
          text: "Kimyasal tepkimede atomlar yok olmaz, yoktan da var olmaz. Yaln\u0131zca
            aralar\u0131ndaki ba\u011Flar kopar ve yeni ba\u011Flar kurulur. Bu y\xFCzden
            tepkimeden \xF6nce ve sonra her elementin atom say\u0131s\u0131 ayn\u0131d\u0131r."
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 9
          text: 
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 2
          text: "Kazan\u0131n terazisi de bunu \xF6l\xE7er"
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 5
          text: 
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts:
          - element: H
            left: 4
            right: 4
          - element: O
            left: 2
            right: 2
        - kind: 4
          text: "2H<sub>2</sub> + O<sub>2</sub> \u2192 2H<sub>2</sub>O"
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 10
          text: "Lavoisier, 1789: k\xFCtlenin korunumu kanunu. C\xE2bir\u2019e atfedilen
            yaz\u0131lar bu i\u015Fe terazi ilmi der."
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
      - blocks:
        - kind: 1
          text: "Nas\u0131l denkle\u015Ftirilir?"
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 6
          text: 
          detail: 
          items:
          - "Girenleri (tepkenleri) sola, \xFCr\xFCnleri sa\u011Fa yaz."
          - "Her elementin atomlar\u0131n\u0131 iki tarafta ayr\u0131 ayr\u0131 say."
          - "Eksik kalan tarafta maddenin \xF6n\xFCne katsay\u0131 yaz."
          - "B\xFCt\xFCn elementler e\u015Fitlenince dur. Katsay\u0131lar en k\xFC\xE7\xFCk
            tam say\u0131lar olsun."
          counts: []
        - kind: 9
          text: 
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 8
          text: "2H<sub>2</sub>O\u2019daki b\xFCy\xFCk 2 katsay\u0131d\u0131r, ka\xE7
            su molek\xFCl\xFC oldu\u011Funu s\xF6yler. K\xFC\xE7\xFCk 2 alt indistir
            ve maddenin kendisidir. Alt indisi de\u011Fi\u015Ftirirsen madde de\u011Fi\u015Fir:
            H<sub>2</sub>O<sub>2</sub> su de\u011Fildir."
          detail: Dikkat
          items: []
          counts: []
      - blocks:
        - kind: 0
          text: "\xC7\xF6z\xFCml\xFC \xF6rnek"
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 1
          text: "H<sub>2</sub> + Cl<sub>2</sub> \u2192 HCl"
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 5
          text: 
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts:
          - element: H
            left: 2
            right: 1
          - element: Cl
            left: 2
            right: 1
        - kind: 3
          text: "Sa\u011Fda hem H hem Cl birer atom eksik. Alt indise dokunmadan
            HCl\u2019nin \xF6n\xFCne 2 yaz:"
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 1
          text: "H<sub>2</sub> + Cl<sub>2</sub> \u2192 2HCl"
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 5
          text: 
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts:
          - element: H
            left: 2
            right: 2
          - element: Cl
            left: 2
            right: 2
      - blocks:
        - kind: 0
          text: "Bu g\xF6revde"
          detail: "Muhtar Yusuf, meydan \xE7e\u015Fmesi"
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 1
          text: "\xC7e\u015Fmeye su"
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 3
          text: "Sipari\u015F kart\u0131 neyin girip neyin \xE7\u0131kaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131
            s\xF6yler. Ka\xE7 kavanoz gerekti\u011Fini sen bulacaks\u0131n."
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 6
          text: 
          detail: 
          items:
          - "Pazardan ya da raftan H<sub>2</sub> ve O<sub>2</sub> kavanozlar\u0131n\u0131
            al."
          - "Kazana birer birer d\xF6k. Her d\xF6k\xFC\u015Fte teraziye bak: H ve
            O iki kefede ayr\u0131 ayr\u0131 e\u015Fit mi?"
          - "Terazi dengeye gelince oca\u011F\u0131 yak."
          counts: []
        - kind: 9
          text: 
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 7
          text: "D\xF6k\xFClen kavanoz geri al\u0131nmaz. D\xF6kmeden \xF6nce say."
          detail: Unutma
          items: []
          counts: []
    reasoning:
      question: "Peki \xE7\u0131rak, neden iki su molek\xFCl\xFC elde ettin?"
      options:
      - "Bir O<sub>2</sub>'de iki oksijen atomu var; her su bir oksijen al\u0131yor,
        o y\xFCzden iki su olu\u015Fuyor."
      - "Suyun form\xFCl\xFC 2H<sub>2</sub>O'dur."
      - "\u0130ki hidrojen kavanozu koydum, oksijenin say\u0131s\u0131 \xF6nemli
        de\u011Fil."
      correctIndex: 0
      replies:
      - "Aynen \xF6yle. Atomlar\u0131 sayd\u0131n, kazan da sana hak verdi."
      - "Hay\u0131r \xE7\u0131rak: 2, ka\xE7 tane su oldu\u011Funu s\xF6yler. Suyun
        form\xFCl\xFC yine H<sub>2</sub>O'dur; katsay\u0131 form\xFCl\xFCn par\xE7as\u0131
        de\u011Fildir."
      - "Tek elemente bakma. Oksijen de say\u0131l\u0131r: bir O<sub>2</sub> iki
        oksijen getirir, ikisi de bir suya gider."
    discoveryId: K-1
    discoveryText: "Tepkimede atomlar\u0131n t\xFCr\xFC ve say\u0131s\u0131 korunur;
      de\u011Fi\u015Fen, atomlar\u0131n birbirine ba\u011Flan\u0131\u015F\u0131d\u0131r.
      Su olu\u015Furken her 2 H<sub>2</sub> i\xE7in 1 O<sub>2</sub> harcan\u0131r."
    topic: "K\xFCtlenin korunumu ve denklem denkle\u015Ftirme"
    title: "Kuru \xC7e\u015Fme"
    placeLine: "Muhtar Yusuf, meydan \xE7e\u015Fmesi"
    equation: "2H<sub>2</sub> + O<sub>2</sub> \u2192 2H<sub>2</sub>O"
    iconFormula: H2O
    usage: 
    fieldNotes:
    - subject: Matematik
      heading: Matematik, oran
      text: "6 su i\xE7in 6 H<sub>2</sub> ve 3 O<sub>2</sub> gerekir."
    - subject: Biyoloji
      heading: "Biyoloji, su d\xF6ng\xFCs\xFC"
      text: "Dere kurudu: d\xF6ng\xFCde ya\u011F\u0131\u015F eksik."
  - taskId: denk_2
    lesson:
      title: Yanma
      pages:
      - blocks:
        - kind: 0
          text: Ders notu
          detail: "Denkle\u015Ftirme K\xF6y\xFC, 2. g\xF6rev"
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 1
          text: Yanma
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 3
          text: "Yanma, bir maddenin oksijenle tepkimeye girip \u0131s\u0131 ve \u0131\u015F\u0131k
            vermesidir. Karbon ve hidrojenden olu\u015Fan yak\u0131tlar yeterli oksijenle
            yan\u0131nca karbondioksit ve su verir."
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 4
          text: "yak\u0131t + O<sub>2</sub> \u2192 CO<sub>2</sub> + H<sub>2</sub>O"
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 9
          text: 
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 2
          text: Hava yetmezse
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 3
          text: "Yanma eksik kal\u0131r: alev sar\u0131la\u015F\u0131r, is (karbon)
            ve karbon monoksit \xE7\u0131kar. Fenerlerin islenmesinin sebebi budur."
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 10
          text: "Evlere gelen do\u011Fal gaz\u0131n b\xFCy\xFCk k\u0131sm\u0131 metand\u0131r;
            ocakta mavi alevle yanar."
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
      - blocks:
        - kind: 1
          text: "Yak\u0131t nas\u0131l denkle\u015Ftirilir?"
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 6
          text: 
          detail: 
          items:
          - "\xD6nce karbonu e\u015Fitle: CO<sub>2</sub>\u2019nin \xF6n\xFCne yak\u0131ttaki
            C say\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 yaz."
          - "Sonra hidrojeni e\u015Fitle: her H<sub>2</sub>O iki H al\u0131r."
          - "En son oksijeni say: sa\u011Fdaki b\xFCt\xFCn O\u2019lar\u0131 topla,
            O<sub>2</sub> ile kar\u015F\u0131la."
          - "Oksijen en sona kal\u0131r, \xE7\xFCnk\xFC O<sub>2</sub> ba\u015Fka
            bir elementi bozmaz."
          counts: []
        - kind: 9
          text: 
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 8
          text: "Oksijeni yaln\u0131zca CO<sub>2</sub>\u2019de sayma. Sudaki oksijen
            de sa\u011F tarafa dahildir."
          detail: Dikkat
          items: []
          counts: []
      - blocks:
        - kind: 0
          text: "\xC7\xF6z\xFCml\xFC \xF6rnek"
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 1
          text: "C<sub>2</sub>H<sub>4</sub> + O<sub>2</sub> \u2192 CO<sub>2</sub>
            + H<sub>2</sub>O"
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 6
          text: 
          detail: 
          items:
          - "C: solda 2 var. Sa\u011Fa 2CO<sub>2</sub> yaz."
          - "H: solda 4 var. Sa\u011Fa 2H<sub>2</sub>O yaz."
          - "O: sa\u011Fda 2\xB72 + 2 = 6 oldu. Sola 3O<sub>2</sub> yaz."
          counts: []
        - kind: 4
          text: "C<sub>2</sub>H<sub>4</sub> + 3O<sub>2</sub> \u2192 2CO<sub>2</sub>
            + 2H<sub>2</sub>O"
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 5
          text: 
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts:
          - element: C
            left: 2
            right: 2
          - element: H
            left: 4
            right: 4
          - element: O
            left: 6
            right: 6
      - blocks:
        - kind: 0
          text: "Bu g\xF6revde"
          detail: "Fenerci Demir, \xE7ar\u015F\u0131 fenerleri"
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 1
          text: Fenerlere temiz alev
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 3
          text: "Fenercinin gaz\u0131 metand\u0131r: CH<sub>4</sub>. Oksijeni ne
            eksik ne fazla vereceksin."
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 6
          text: 
          detail: 
          items:
          - Raftan ya da pazardan CH<sub>4</sub> ve O<sub>2</sub> al.
          - "\xD6nce C ve H\u2019yi iki kefede e\u015Fitle."
          - "Sonra O<sub>2</sub>\u2019yi teker teker d\xF6k, O say\u0131s\u0131n\u0131
            izle."
          - "Terazi dengeye gelince oca\u011F\u0131 yak."
          counts: []
        - kind: 9
          text: 
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 7
          text: "Fazla O<sub>2</sub> de dengeyi bozar; denge yoksa kazan k\xF6p\xFCr\xFCr."
          detail: Unutma
          items: []
          counts: []
    reasoning:
      question: "Neden bir de\u011Fil iki O<sub>2</sub> koydun?"
      options:
      - "CO<sub>2</sub>'deki 2 ve iki suyun i\xE7indeki 2 oksijen eder 4; her O<sub>2</sub>
        iki oksijen getirir."
      - "Metan \xE7ok yan\u0131c\u0131, fazladan hava iyi gelir."
      - Karbon iki oksijen istiyor, bir O<sub>2</sub> yeter.
      correctIndex: 0
      replies:
      - "Aynen \xF6yle. Oksijeni iki \xFCr\xFCn\xFCn i\xE7inde ayr\u0131 ayr\u0131
        sayd\u0131n."
      - "Sezgi g\xFCzel ama say\u0131m yok. Fazla hava iyi gelmez, yaln\u0131zca
        artar. 4 oksijen gerekir, o kadar."
      - "Suyu unuttun. Karbondioksit 2 oksijen al\u0131r, iki su da 2 oksijen daha:
        toplam 4, yani iki O<sub>2</sub>."
    discoveryId: K-2
    discoveryText: "Yanma tepkimelerinde oksijenin rol\xFC vard\u0131r: yak\u0131t
      O<sub>2</sub> ile birle\u015Fir. Karbon ve hidrojen i\xE7eren yak\u0131tlar
      CO<sub>2</sub> ve H<sub>2</sub>O verir. Hava yetmezse is (karbon) ve CO \xE7\u0131kar."
    topic: Yanma tepkimeleri
    title: "\u0130sli Fenerler"
    placeLine: "Fenerci Demir, \xE7ar\u015F\u0131 fenerleri"
    equation: "CH<sub>4</sub> + 2O<sub>2</sub> \u2192 CO<sub>2</sub> + 2H<sub>2</sub>O"
    iconFormula: CH4
    usage: "Bu sayfa F\u0131r\u0131nc\u0131n\u0131n Mektubu\u2019nda i\u015Fe yarayacak."
    fieldNotes:
    - subject: Biyoloji
      heading: "Biyoloji, h\xFCcresel solunum"
      text: "H\xFCcre de besini O<sub>2</sub> ile kullan\u0131r; CO<sub>2</sub> ve
        su \xE7\u0131kar, ama yava\u015F ve ad\u0131m ad\u0131m."
    - subject: Fizik
      heading: "Fizik, enerji bi\xE7imleri"
      text: "Fenerde kimyasal enerji \u0131s\u0131ya ve \u0131\u015F\u0131\u011Fa
        d\xF6n\xFC\u015F\xFCr."
  - taskId: denk_3
    lesson:
      title: "S\u0131rayla say"
      pages:
      - blocks:
        - kind: 0
          text: Ders notu
          detail: "Denkle\u015Ftirme K\xF6y\xFC, 3. g\xF6rev"
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 1
          text: "S\u0131rayla say"
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 3
          text: "Molek\xFCl b\xFCy\xFCd\xFCk\xE7e atom say\u0131s\u0131 artar ama
            y\xF6ntem de\u011Fi\u015Fmez. Kar\u0131\u015Fmas\u0131n diye hep ayn\u0131
            s\u0131ray\u0131 izle: \xF6nce karbon, sonra hidrojen, en son oksijen."
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 9
          text: 
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 2
          text: Neden oksijen en sonda?
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 3
          text: "Oksijen hem CO<sub>2</sub>\u2019de hem H<sub>2</sub>O\u2019da var.
            Karbon ve hidrojen yerine oturmadan oksijeni sayarsan her de\u011Fi\u015Fiklikte
            ba\u015Ftan saymak zorunda kal\u0131rs\u0131n. O<sub>2</sub> yaln\u0131z
            oksijen ta\u015F\u0131r; en son onunla tamamlamak kolayd\u0131r."
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 10
          text: "T\xFCp gaz \xE7o\u011Funlukla propan ve b\xFCtand\u0131r. Tam yan\u0131nca
            alevi mavi olur."
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
      - blocks:
        - kind: 1
          text: "Katsay\u0131 b\xFCt\xFCn molek\xFCl\xFC \xE7arpar"
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 6
          text: 
          detail: 
          items:
          - "Katsay\u0131 ile alt indisi \xE7arp: 3CO<sub>2</sub> i\xE7inde 3 C ve
            6 O var."
          - "4H<sub>2</sub>O i\xE7inde 8 H ve 4 O var."
          - "Oksijen say\u0131s\u0131 tek \xE7\u0131karsa b\xFCt\xFCn katsay\u0131lar\u0131
            2 ile \xE7arp\u0131p yeniden say."
          counts: []
        - kind: 9
          text: 
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 8
          text: "Katsay\u0131y\u0131 yaln\u0131zca ilk atoma uygulama. 3CO<sub>2</sub>,
            3 C ve 6 O demektir; 3 C ve 2 O de\u011Fil."
          detail: Dikkat
          items: []
          counts: []
      - blocks:
        - kind: 0
          text: "\xC7\xF6z\xFCml\xFC \xF6rnek"
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 1
          text: "C<sub>2</sub>H<sub>6</sub> + O<sub>2</sub> \u2192 CO<sub>2</sub>
            + H<sub>2</sub>O"
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 6
          text: 
          detail: 
          items:
          - "C: 2 karbon i\xE7in sa\u011Fa 2CO<sub>2</sub>."
          - "H: 6 hidrojen i\xE7in sa\u011Fa 3H<sub>2</sub>O."
          - "O: sa\u011Fda 4 + 3 = 7 oksijen, tek say\u0131. Hepsini 2 ile \xE7arp."
          counts: []
        - kind: 4
          text: "2C<sub>2</sub>H<sub>6</sub> + 7O<sub>2</sub> \u2192 4CO<sub>2</sub>
            + 6H<sub>2</sub>O"
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 5
          text: 
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts:
          - element: C
            left: 4
            right: 4
          - element: H
            left: 12
            right: 12
          - element: O
            left: 14
            right: 14
      - blocks:
        - kind: 0
          text: "Bu g\xF6revde"
          detail: "F\u0131r\u0131nc\u0131 Zehra, kasaba f\u0131r\u0131n\u0131"
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 1
          text: "F\u0131r\u0131n\u0131 yeniden yak"
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 3
          text: "F\u0131r\u0131n\u0131n yak\u0131t\u0131 propand\u0131r: C<sub>3</sub>H<sub>8</sub>.
            Bu kez sipari\u015F kart\u0131nda yaln\u0131zca \xFCr\xFCnler yaz\u0131yor;
            girenleri sen kuracaks\u0131n."
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 6
          text: 
          detail: 
          items:
          - "Sa\u011F kefeye bak: C, H ve O\u2019dan ka\xE7ar tane var?"
          - "\xD6nce C<sub>3</sub>H<sub>8</sub> d\xF6k. C ve H iki kefede e\u015Fit
            mi?"
          - "En son O<sub>2</sub>\u2019yi teker teker ekle, oksijeni iki kefede topla."
          - "Terazi dengeye gelince oca\u011F\u0131 yak."
          counts: []
        - kind: 9
          text: 
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 7
          text: "Katsay\u0131 kavanoz say\u0131s\u0131d\u0131r: 3O<sub>2</sub> \xFC\xE7
            kavanoz, ama alt\u0131 oksijen atomu."
          detail: Unutma
          items: []
          counts: []
