  - taskId: denk_4
    lesson:
      title: "Ara \xFCr\xFCn"
      pages:
      - blocks:
        - kind: 0
          text: Ders notu
          detail: "Denkle\u015Ftirme K\xF6y\xFC, 4. g\xF6rev"
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 1
          text: "Ara \xFCr\xFCn"
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 3
          text: "Baz\u0131 \xFCr\xFCnler tek tepkimede elde edilmez. \xD6nce bir
            ara \xFCr\xFCn yap\u0131l\u0131r, sonra o ara \xFCr\xFCn yeni bir tepkimeye
            girer."
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 9
          text: 
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 2
          text: Analiz ve sentez
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 3
          text: "Analizde (ayr\u0131\u015Fma) tek bir madde daha basit maddelere
            ayr\u0131l\u0131r. Sentezde (olu\u015Fum) birden \xE7ok madde birle\u015Fip
            tek bir \xFCr\xFCn verir."
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 10
          text: "Kire\xE7li har\xE7 duvarda havadaki CO<sub>2</sub>\u2019yi yava\u015F
            yava\u015F geri al\u0131r ve ta\u015Fa d\xF6ner; bu y\xFCzden sertle\u015Fir."
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
      - blocks:
        - kind: 1
          text: "Her denklem katsay\u0131 istemez"
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 6
          text: 
          detail: 
          items:
          - 'Denklemi yaz ve hemen say: belki zaten denktir.'
          - "Denkse b\xFCt\xFCn katsay\u0131lar 1\u2019dir; 1 yaz\u0131lmaz."
          - "Birinci ad\u0131m\u0131n \xFCr\xFCn\xFC, ikinci ad\u0131m\u0131n gireni
            olur. Onu kaybetme."
          counts: []
        - kind: 9
          text: 
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 8
          text: "Gaz \xE7\u0131k\u0131nca k\xFCtle kaybolmaz. Kire\xE7 ta\u015F\u0131
            \u0131s\u0131t\u0131l\u0131nca hafifler, \xE7\xFCnk\xFC CO<sub>2</sub>
            havaya kar\u0131\u015F\u0131r; atomlar\u0131 ba\u015Fka bir maddededir."
          detail: Dikkat
          items: []
          counts: []
      - blocks:
        - kind: 0
          text: "\xC7\xF6z\xFCml\xFC \xF6rnek"
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 2
          text: "1. ad\u0131m, sentez"
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 4
          text: "C + O<sub>2</sub> \u2192 CO<sub>2</sub>"
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 2
          text: "2. ad\u0131m, CO<sub>2</sub> ara \xFCr\xFCn"
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 4
          text: "CO<sub>2</sub> + H<sub>2</sub>O \u2192 H<sub>2</sub>CO<sub>3</sub>"
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 5
          text: 
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts:
          - element: C
            left: 1
            right: 1
          - element: H
            left: 2
            right: 2
          - element: O
            left: 3
            right: 3
        - kind: 3
          text: "\u0130ki denklem de zaten denk: katsay\u0131 yok. Gazozdaki karbonik
            asit b\xF6yle olu\u015Fur."
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
      - blocks:
        - kind: 0
          text: "Bu g\xF6revde"
          detail: "Duvarc\u0131 Halil, y\u0131k\u0131k k\xF6pr\xFC"
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 1
          text: "Ta\u015Ftan harca"
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 3
          text: "Halil s\xF6nm\xFC\u015F kire\xE7 istiyor: Ca(OH)<sub>2</sub>. Elinde
            kire\xE7 ta\u015F\u0131 (CaCO<sub>3</sub>) ve su var. \u0130\u015F iki
            ad\u0131mda biter."
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 6
          text: 
          detail: 
          items:
          - "Birinci ad\u0131m: kire\xE7 ta\u015F\u0131n\u0131 ayr\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r.
            Ta\u015F, s\xF6nmemi\u015F kirece (CaO) ve CO<sub>2</sub>\u2019ye ayr\u0131l\u0131r."
          - "\u0130kinci ad\u0131m: ara \xFCr\xFCn CaO\u2019yu suyla birle\u015Ftir."
          - "Her ad\u0131mda \xF6nce say, sonra d\xF6k."
          counts: []
        - kind: 9
          text: 
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 7
          text: Saymadan kavanoz ekleme. Fazla madde de dengeyi bozar.
          detail: Unutma
          items: []
          counts: []
    reasoning:
      question: "Kire\xE7 ta\u015F\u0131n\u0131n i\xE7indeki karbon nereye gitti?"
