          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 3
          text: "Her 2 H<sub>2</sub> i\xE7in 1 O<sub>2</sub> harcan\u0131r ve 2 H<sub>2</sub>O
            \xE7\u0131kar. Oran 2\_:\_1\_:\_2."
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 9
          text: 
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 2
          text: Biri biterse
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 3
          text: "Tepkime, girenlerden biri bitince durur. \xD6nce biten maddeye s\u0131n\u0131rlay\u0131c\u0131
            bile\u015Fen denir. \xD6teki madde fazla kal\u0131r; buna artan madde
            denir."
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 10
          text: "Havadaki azottan amonyak yapmak, bug\xFCn g\xFCbrenin temel kayna\u011F\u0131d\u0131r."
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
      - blocks:
        - kind: 1
          text: "\u0130stenen kadar \xFCret"
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 6
          text: 
          detail: 
          items:
          - "\xD6nce denklemi en k\xFC\xE7\xFCk katsay\u0131larla denkle\u015Ftir."
          - "\u0130stenen \xFCr\xFCn ka\xE7 kat\u0131ysa b\xFCt\xFCn katsay\u0131lar\u0131
            o say\u0131yla \xE7arp."
          - "Tam o kadar al. Artan madde bo\u015Fa gider, paras\u0131 da gider."
          counts: []
        - kind: 9
          text: 
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 8
          text: "Katlarken yaln\u0131zca \xFCr\xFCn\xFC \xE7arpma. B\xFCt\xFCn katsay\u0131lar
            ayn\u0131 say\u0131yla \xE7arp\u0131l\u0131r, yoksa denge bozulur."
          detail: Dikkat
          items: []
          counts: []
      - blocks:
        - kind: 0
          text: "\xC7\xF6z\xFCml\xFC \xF6rnek"
