          counts: []
        - kind: 1
          text: "Tohum nefes al\u0131r"
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 3
          text: "Tohumun i\xE7inde depolanm\u0131\u015F besin vard\u0131r. Tohum
            \xE7imlenirken bu besini oksijenli solunumla kullan\u0131r ve b\xFCy\xFCmek
            i\xE7in gereken enerjiyi elde eder."
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 4
          text: "besin (glikoz) + O<sub>2</sub> \u2192 CO<sub>2</sub> + H<sub>2</sub>O
            + enerji"
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 9
          text: 
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 2
          text: "Topra\u011F\u0131 neden s\xFCreriz?"
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 3
          text: "S\xFCr\xFClm\xFC\u015F toprak gev\u015Fektir; aras\u0131nda hava
            (oksijen) ve su tutulur. S\u0131k\u0131\u015Fm\u0131\u015F toprakta tohum
            yeterince oksijen bulamaz, \xE7imlenme azal\u0131r."
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 10
          text: "Bu denklemi tan\u0131yorsun: yanmaya benzer (K-2). Ama h\xFCcrede
            yava\u015F ve ad\u0131m ad\u0131m olur; alev \xE7\u0131kmaz."
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
      - blocks:
        - kind: 0
          text: "Hesap Ustas\u0131"
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 1
          text: "Ka\xE7 tanesi \xE7imlenir?"
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 3
          text: "\xC7imlenme olas\u0131l\u0131\u011F\u0131 0,8 ise her 10 tohumdan
            yakla\u015F\u0131k 8'i \xE7imlenir."
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 6
          text: 
          detail: 
          items:
          - "Beklenen say\u0131 = olas\u0131l\u0131k \xD7 tohum say\u0131s\u0131."
          - "Tersinden: istenen filiz biliniyorsa tohum = filiz \xF7 olas\u0131l\u0131k."
          - "Tohum kesede sat\u0131l\u0131yorsa kese say\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 yukar\u0131
            yuvarla."
          counts: []
        - kind: 9
          text: 
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 8
          text: "Filiz say\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 olas\u0131l\u0131kla \xE7arpma, b\xF6l.
            \xC7arparsan daha az tohum bulursun, tarla bo\u015F kal\u0131r. Sonucu
            kendine sor: bu kadar tohumun y\xFCzde 80'i istedi\u011Fim say\u0131
            m\u0131?"
          detail: Dikkat
          items: []
          counts: []
      - blocks:
        - kind: 0
          text: "\xC7\xF6z\xFCml\xFC \xF6rnek"
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 1
          text: Bostanda karpuz
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 3
          text: "Bostanc\u0131 Osman 45 karpuz fidesi istiyor. Karpuz tohumunun \xE7imlenme
            olas\u0131l\u0131\u011F\u0131 0,9; tohum 10'luk paketlerde."
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 6
          text: 
          detail: 
          items:
          - "Tohum = 45 \xF7 0,9 = 50."
          - "Kontrol: 50 \xD7 0,9 = 45."
          - "Paket: 50 \xF7 10 = 5 paket."
          counts: []
        - kind: 7
          text: "Beklenen say\u0131 ortalamad\u0131r. 50 tohumdan 44 de \xE7\u0131kabilir,
            47 de."
          detail: Unutma
          items: []
          counts: []
      - blocks:
        - kind: 0
          text: "Bu g\xF6revde"
          detail: "\xC7ift\xE7i Elif, Bereket Tarlas\u0131"
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 1
          text: "Tarla bo\u015F kalmas\u0131n"
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 3
          text: "Elif 120 \xF6bek filiz istiyor. Tohumun \xE7imlenme olas\u0131l\u0131\u011F\u0131
            0,8; pazarda tohum 10'luk keselerde."
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 6
          text: 
          detail: 
          items:
          - "Ka\xE7 tohum gerekti\u011Fini hesapla."
          - Pazardan tam o kadar kese al.
          - "Tarladaki ekim sand\u0131\u011F\u0131na d\xF6k."
          counts: []
        - kind: 9
          text: 
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 7
          text: "D\xF6k\xFClen tohum geri al\u0131nmaz; fazla kese ak\xE7eni bo\u015Fa
            harcar."
          detail: Unutma
          items: []
          counts: []
    reasoning:
      question: "150 tohum ektin. Tarlada kesin 120 filiz mi \xE7\u0131kar?"
      options:
      - "Hay\u0131r; 120 beklenen say\u0131d\u0131r, biraz az ya da \xE7ok \xE7\u0131kabilir."
      - "Evet, hesap do\u011Fruysa tam 120 \xE7\u0131kar."
      - "Hay\u0131r; olas\u0131l\u0131k 0,8 oldu\u011Fu i\xE7in hep 80 \xE7\u0131kar."
      correctIndex: 0
      replies:
      - "Aynen \xF6yle. Beklenen say\u0131 ortalamad\u0131r: 150 tohumdan 114 de
        \xE7\u0131kabilir, 126 da. \xC7ok kez ekersen ortalamas\u0131 120'ye yakla\u015F\u0131r."
      - "Olas\u0131l\u0131k kesinlik vermez, \xE7\u0131rak. 120 bekledi\u011Fimiz
        ortalamad\u0131r; bu y\u0131l biraz az ya da \xE7ok \xE7\u0131kabilir."
      - "0,8 bir oran: her 10 tohumdan yakla\u015F\u0131k 8'i. 150 tohumda bu 120
        eder, 80 de\u011Fil."
