  - taskId: tur_1
    lesson:
      title: "G\xF6zlemden t\xFCre"
      pages:
      - blocks:
        - kind: 0
          text: Ders notu
          detail: "Tepkime T\xFCrleri K\xF6y\xFC, 1. g\xF6rev"
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 1
          text: "G\xF6zlem kan\u0131tt\u0131r"
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 3
          text: "Bir tepkimenin t\xFCr\xFCn\xFC anlamak i\xE7in \xF6nce ne g\xF6rd\xFC\u011F\xFCne
            bak: ka\xE7 madde girdi, ka\xE7 madde \xE7\u0131kt\u0131, \u0131s\u0131
            ya da \u0131\u015F\u0131k var m\u0131? G\xF6zlem, t\xFCr\xFCn kan\u0131t\u0131d\u0131r."
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 9
          text: 
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 2
          text: "Her olayda \xFC\xE7 soru sor"
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 6
          text: 
          detail: 
          items:
          - "Girenler ka\xE7 tane: tek madde mi, birden \xE7ok mu?"
          - "\xDCr\xFCnler ka\xE7 tane: tek \xFCr\xFCn m\xFC, birden \xE7ok mu?"
          - "Bir yak\u0131t oksijenle yan\u0131yor mu, \u0131s\u0131 ve \u0131\u015F\u0131k
            \xE7\u0131k\u0131yor mu?"
          counts: []
        - kind: 10
          text: "Bu k\xF6yde \xFC\xE7 t\xFCrle \xE7al\u0131\u015Facaks\u0131n: sentez,
            analiz, yanma."
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
      - blocks:
        - kind: 1
          text: "\xDC\xE7 t\xFCr"
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 2
          text: "Sentez (birle\u015Fme)"
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 3
          text: "Birden \xE7ok madde birle\u015Fir, tek bir \xFCr\xFCn olu\u015Fur."
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 2
          text: "Analiz (ayr\u0131\u015Fma)"
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 3
          text: "Tek bir madde daha basit maddelere ayr\u0131l\u0131r."
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 2
          text: Yanma
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 3
          text: "Bir madde oksijenle tepkimeye girer; genellikle \u0131s\u0131 ve
            \u0131\u015F\u0131k \xE7\u0131kar."
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 9
          text: 
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 8
          text: "Is\u0131nan her kap yanma de\u011Fildir. Kire\xE7 s\xF6nd\xFCr\xFCl\xFCrken
            kova \u0131s\u0131n\u0131r ama ortada alev ve oksijen yoktur: s\xF6nmemi\u015F
            kire\xE7 suyla birle\u015Fip tek \xFCr\xFCn verir."
          detail: Dikkat
          items: []
          counts: []
      - blocks:
        - kind: 0
          text: "\xC7\xF6z\xFCml\xFC \xF6rnek"
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 1
          text: "G\xFCm\xFC\u015F ka\u015F\u0131k karard\u0131"
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 3
          text: "G\xF6zlem: parlak g\xFCm\xFC\u015F ka\u015F\u0131k, havadaki k\xFCk\xFCrtle
            birle\u015Fti; y\xFCzeyinde tek bir siyah madde olu\u015Ftu."
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 6
          text: 
          detail: 
          items:
          - "Girenler: g\xFCm\xFC\u015F ve k\xFCk\xFCrt, iki madde."
          - "\xDCr\xFCn: tek bir siyah madde."
          - "Alev yok, oksijen yanm\u0131yor."
          counts: []
        - kind: 4
          text: "2Ag + S \u2192 Ag<sub>2</sub>S"
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 3
          text: "Birden \xE7ok giren, tek \xFCr\xFCn: sentez."
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
      - blocks:
        - kind: 0
          text: "Bu g\xF6revde"
          detail: "C\xE2bir Usta\u2019n\u0131n defteri, \xE7al\u0131\u015Fma masas\u0131"
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 1
          text: Defteri tamamla
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 3
          text: "Usta masaya, kazanda senin g\xF6rd\xFC\u011F\xFCn olaylar\u0131n
            g\xF6zlem kartlar\u0131n\u0131 b\u0131rakt\u0131. Defterinin baz\u0131
            sat\u0131rlar\u0131 da \u0131slan\u0131p silinmi\u015F."
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 6
          text: 
          detail: 
          items:
          - "Her kartta \xFC\xE7 soruyu sor: ka\xE7 giren, ka\xE7 \xFCr\xFCn, yanma
            var m\u0131?"
          - "Kart\u0131 kan\u0131t\u0131 oldu\u011Fu t\xFCr\xFCn kutusuna koy."
          - "Sonra defterin bo\u015F sat\u0131rlar\u0131n\u0131 kelime bankas\u0131yla
            doldur."
          counts: []
        - kind: 9
          text: 
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 7
          text: "Kelime bankas\u0131nda fazladan kelimeler var; hepsini kullanmak
            zorunda de\u011Filsin."
          detail: Unutma
          items: []
          counts: []
