  - taskId: tur_4
    lesson:
      title: "Yanl\u0131\u015F iddiay\u0131 d\xFCzelt"
      pages:
      - blocks:
        - kind: 0
          text: Ders notu
          detail: "Tepkime T\xFCrleri K\xF6y\xFC, 4. g\xF6rev"
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 1
          text: "Bir iddia nas\u0131l s\u0131nan\u0131r?"
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 3
          text: "Bir c\xFCmlenin do\u011Fru oldu\u011Funu s\xF6ylemek i\xE7in bildi\u011Fin
            kurallarla kar\u015F\u0131la\u015Ft\u0131r. Yanl\u0131\u015F oldu\u011Funu
            g\xF6stermek i\xE7in tek bir kar\u015F\u0131 \xF6rnek yeter."
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 9
          text: 
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 2
          text: "\xDC\xE7 ad\u0131m"
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 6
          text: 
          detail: 
          items:
          - "\u0130ddiay\u0131 dikkatle oku: hangi t\xFCr ya da hangi kural hakk\u0131nda?"
          - "Bildi\u011Fin tan\u0131mla ve bir \xF6rnek denklemle kar\u015F\u0131la\u015Ft\u0131r."
          - "Yanl\u0131\u015Fsa do\u011Frusunu s\xF6yle ve kan\u0131t\u0131n\u0131
            g\xF6ster."
          counts: []
        - kind: 10
          text: "Dedikoduya kar\u015F\u0131 en iyi ila\xE7 kan\u0131tt\u0131r."
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
      - blocks:
        - kind: 1
          text: "S\u0131k duyulan yan\u0131lg\u0131lar"
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 8
          text: "\u201CYanan odun hafifliyor, demek ki k\xFCtle kayboldu.\u201D Kaybolmad\u0131:
            CO<sub>2</sub> ve su buhar\u0131 havaya kar\u0131\u015Ft\u0131. Atomlar
            ba\u015Fka maddelerde."
          detail: "Yan\u0131lg\u0131"
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 8
          text: "\u201C2H<sub>2</sub>O\u2019daki 2, suyun form\xFCl\xFCne aittir.\u201D
            Hay\u0131r: katsay\u0131 ka\xE7 molek\xFCl oldu\u011Funu s\xF6yler. Suyun
            form\xFCl\xFC H<sub>2</sub>O\u2019dur."
          detail: "Yan\u0131lg\u0131"
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 9
          text: 
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 7
          text: Atomlar tepkimede kaybolmaz, yoktan da var olmaz (K-0).
          detail: Unutma
          items: []
          counts: []
      - blocks:
        - kind: 0
          text: "\xC7\xF6z\xFCml\xFC \xF6rnek"
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 1
          text: "\u201CHer yanma CO<sub>2</sub> verir.\u201D"
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 3
          text: "Kar\u015F\u0131 \xF6rnek ara: karbon i\xE7ermeyen bir yak\u0131t
            var m\u0131?"
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 4
          text: "2H<sub>2</sub> + O<sub>2</sub> \u2192 2H<sub>2</sub>O"
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 3
          text: "Hidrojen oksijenle yanar ama karbon yoktur, CO<sub>2</sub> de \xE7\u0131kmaz.
            Tek \xF6rnek iddiay\u0131 \xE7\xFCr\xFCtt\xFC."
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 2
          text: "Do\u011Frusu"
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 3
          text: "Karbon i\xE7eren yak\u0131tlar yan\u0131nca CO<sub>2</sub> verir."
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
      - blocks:
        - kind: 0
          text: "Bu g\xF6revde"
          detail: "Muhtar Yusuf\u2019un mektubu, \xE7al\u0131\u015Fma masas\u0131"
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 1
          text: Kasabadaki dedikodular
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 3
          text: "Muhtar kasabada dola\u015Fan c\xFCmleleri g\xF6nderdi. Hangisi do\u011Fru,
            hangisi yanl\u0131\u015F, m\xFCh\xFCrle i\u015Faretleyeceksin."
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 6
          text: 
          detail: 
          items:
          - "Her c\xFCmleyi tan\u0131mlarla kar\u015F\u0131la\u015Ft\u0131r."
          - "Do\u011Fruysa D, yanl\u0131\u015Fsa Y m\xFChr\xFC bas."
          - "Y dedi\u011Fin c\xFCmlenin do\u011Frusunu da se\xE7."
          counts: []
        - kind: 9
          text: 
          detail: 
          items: []
          counts: []
        - kind: 7
          text: "Defterindeki kay\u0131tlar kan\u0131tt\u0131r. Sentez, analiz ve
            atomlar\u0131n korunumu i\xE7in \xF6nceki sayfalar\u0131na bak."
